auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  The order queue and the lifecycle. Needs `access_token`, and the transition
  requests need `order_uid` from `guest / place-order`.

  Transitions are validated against the state machine under a row lock, so a 409 means another
  device got there first. Refetch; do not retry.
}
